    "requirements": {
      "summary": "Pocket-sized battery-powered climate logger with BLE phone access, USB-C charging/programming, onboard status indication, and on-module history storage for temperature and humidity readings. Retains reading history in on-module flash for the intended use case of checking every few days, with a target of longer-than-30-day retention at 5-minute intervals if flash budget allows.",
